And we're done, with the Staff of Aesculapius, the Healer's quest
artifact. It may be found at

http://www.deviantart.com/deviation/46929095/

This one was a challenge, I got a decent model for the staff quite
quickly, but making the environment for it was difficult. Couldn't get
a decent island model, couldn't do a decent inside one, so I went for a
surreal one, like I did with the Master Key of Thievery.

I'm very glad they're done, and I feel reasonably proud :) I'm also
(though not immediately) going to be setting up a general roguelike
fanworks gallery, for fanart, fanwriting, anything relating to
roguelikes. Angband, NetHack, Crawl, ADOM, the works.

But for now, enjoy the Staff. When I go back to art again, perhaps some
of the other quest arts.

